Roald Dahl's The Witches is a comedy, fantasy,
family film directed by Robert Zemeckis.

3
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:26,000
In late 1967, a young orphaned boy goes to live with his loving
grandma in the rural Alabama town of Demopolis.

4
00:23:06,666 --> 00:23:12,666
As the boy and his grandmother encounter some deceptively glamorous but thoroughly
diabolical witches, she wisely whisks him away to a seaside resort.

5
00:28:53,333 --> 00:28:59,333
Regrettably, they arrive at precisely the same time that
the world's Grand High Witch has gathered.

