01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
The Witches (also known as Roald Dahl's The Witches), is a 2020 dark fantasy comedy horror film co-produced and directed by Robert
Zemeckis, who co-wrote the screenplay with Kenya Barris and Guillermo del Toro, based on the 1983 novel The Witches by Roald Dahl.

13
01:15:06,666 --> 01:15:12,666
It is the second film adaptation of the novel, following The Witches (1990).

14
01:20:53,333 --> 01:20:59,333
The film stars Anne Hathaway, Octavia Spencer, Stanley Tucci, Kristin
Chenoweth, and Jahzir Bruno, with narration by Chris Rock.

15
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
The Witches was released on the streaming service HBO Max in the United States on October 22, 2020,
and had a theatrical release in some markets beginning on October 28, by Warner Bros.

